# T2.5 equivalence check: 4 SIM (GPU) + 2 ANA ranks, N = 32000.
# Production state point (rho* 0.95, T_q 0.70, seed R 4.5), short hold.
# Analysis every 100 steps from step 6000; full-precision dumps at every
# analysis step (InsituCheck 1) for src/posthoc.
vproc       2 2 1
InitUcell   10 10 20
Density     0.95
InitTemp    2.0
DeltaT      0.005
StepAvg     1000
Thermostat  1
TauT        0.1
TMelt       2.0
StepMelt    5000
TQuench     0.70
StepQuench  2000
StepHold    10000
RSeed       4.5
StepRelease 1000
InsituRanks 2
InsituInterval 100
InsituStart 6000
InsituMovie 0
InsituCheck 1
InsituPrefix check
